id: pm-review-qao6
title: Track upstream pm-changelog release-tag reachability so queued deep snapshots do not drift against newer tags
description: Track adoption of the released pm-changelog descendant-tag exclusion from PR 365. It shipped in 2026.11.18 and prevents a release created while a Deep job is queued from retitling the changelog at an older checkout. This package still pins 2026.11.14. The existing toolchain PR 105 proposes 2026.11.18 and its test gates need repair. Verify before and after on a queued-snapshot fixture while preserving already published changelog sections.
